rop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=41485cb252f0179078a90e5746403ee7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/00dd8e66/uploads/origins/abbdcf62-d0ee-4696-a69a-e890a4f782ab?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e5f0d0bc895d3624a58579b2fcff1576 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "キャラクターはモルモットです\n欠けている模様は月です\nありがとう！\n自分の行動について考えることができない\n二人の仲の良い友達が交流していることを願っていますhttps://imgur.com/a/UekCXf8\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1uJrfJVS-iQyArDU18zkAqhkAzceyOezz/view?usp=drivesdk", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@0mfmff/works/112", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/40d85477/uploads/origins/4bdef0a2-bbd0-4517-8e64-ab0dc4f019ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d6aa40a94eb2b7cecd8da0c431eb953d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/40d85477/uploads/origins/4bdef0a2-bbd0-4517-8e64-ab0dc4f019ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d6aa40a94eb2b7cecd8da0c431eb953d, https://si.imgix.net/40d85477/uploads/origins/4bdef0a2-bbd0-4517-8e64-ab0dc4f019ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e086ab6645f4421ce70bf5bb8cb3e845 2x, https://si.imgix.net/40d85477/uploads/origins/4bdef0a2-bbd0-4517-8e64-ab0dc4f019ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b9c0206803487898cb7e13a774fad5c5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi!\n\nRevisiting you again~! 🥰\n\nCan you draw a friendship commission for these two characters~?\n\n'Maya' :\nhttps://mayafurry.github.io/images/commissions/Maya_sheet_reference.jpg\n\n'Asha' :\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11HNYzqTbQKzPBF12iHAGkxWPXyzbSB-V?usp=drive_link\n\nPlease draw freely, any pose and background will do...!!\n\nThank you~💖", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@0mfmff/works/111", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/eeb3fc36/uploads/origins/0a142bed-9e7c-46b7-aaea-99afb044e279?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=